        "execSummary":  "France\u0027s broad-based agentic AI deployments demonstrate that sovereign AI strategy—owning the infrastructure, models, and talent domestically—is transitioning from policy aspiration to operational reality. For enterprise leaders outside Europe, the article illustrates how open model ecosystems combined with national infrastructure investment can accelerate adoption across industries simultaneously rather than sequentially. The L\u0027Oreal and Mirakl deployments in particular show that agentic computing is moving into consumer-facing and e-commerce operations at enterprise scale. The key implication for global enterprises: sovereign AI programs are creating competitive asymmetries in markets where governments are active investors, which should factor into regional go-to-market and partnership strategies.",
