        "summary":  "Roche\u0027s chief digital and technology officer Wafaa Mamilli details how the pharmaceutical company applies AI across its entire value chain—from kidney disease prediction and digital pathology to drug discovery and manufacturing digital twins. She emphasizes that successful AI outcomes depend on trusted data, strong governance, and employee upskilling, framing AI as fundamentally a human and change-management challenge. Roche\u0027s Galileo enterprise platform serves as the internal generative AI delivery vehicle for these capabilities.",
